# Set the stage
@scenario office_lesson_04
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk neutral]
pip: Our office window tells us where the story happens. Find the image that puts it on screen.
pip: Open the background declaration in scripts/definitions/characters.vns. Find the bg command at the top of this lesson.
@label check
pip: What belongs after bg?
> The name of the current speaker. -> retry
> The ID declared for the office. -> correct
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: The declaration maps an ID to an image. The scene command selects it. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: The declaration maps an ID to an image. The scene command selects it.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_04]
[flag tutorial_done_04]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_1]
